    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24109" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αος</span>, τό, dat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.316
				</span></i>
			: pl. nom. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπᾰ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.466
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπατα</span> dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).450a1
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thera</span>): 
				Ep.
			 dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεπάεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.471
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέπασσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.86
				</span></i>
			:—<i>beaker, goblet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.316
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀμφικύπελλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.584
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. χρυσείοις ἥλοισι πεπαρμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.632
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σκύπφειον</span> Stes. <i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐκ κεράμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.333
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>); of the golden <i>bowl</i> in which the sun floated back
			from West to East during the night, Stes.<i><span class="en">
				8.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecyd.
				18
			</span></i>(a) <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. Ἡφαιστοτυκές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					69
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
